-- ind-c-tests-warning.l4: independent tests (ind-c) of ss.52-54 (gazette pp. 195-196).
-- Scenario ids are those of work/ind-c/expectations.md.

§ `ind-c: ss 52 to 54`

§§ `Fixtures`

`no rest days` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS EMPTY

GIVEN days IS A LIST OF DATE
GIVETH A `Calendar of rest days`
`rest on` days MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS days

`ind-c individual` MEANS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "ind-1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`

GIVEN what IS A `Listed violation`
      d IS A DATE
      isCancelled IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Administrative warning`
`ind-c a warning about` what `delivered on` d `cancelled` isCancelled MEANS
    `Administrative warning` WITH
        `the violator` IS `ind-c individual`
        `the listed violation the warning concerns` IS what
        `delivered on` IS d
        `states the act or omission that is the breach and the date of the breach` IS TRUE
        `tells the violator to stop the breach` IS TRUE
        `warns of a sanction for a continuing or repeat violation` IS TRUE
        `states the violator's right to ask for cancellation under section 53` IS TRUE
        `cancelled under section 53` IS isCancelled

GIVEN what IS A `Listed violation`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A Violation
`ind-c a further violation of` what `on` d MEANS
    Violation WITH `the violator` IS `ind-c individual`
                 , `the listed violation` IS what
                 , `reference for the act` IS "act-after-warning"
                 , `date of the act` IS d

§§ `D17-D19: s 52(a), when a warning may be given instead of a sanction`

-- D17: Chapter 6 in force, reasonable grounds, circumstances listed in the procedures, procedures approved by the AG.
#ASSERT `s 52(a) — the Commissioner may give an administrative warning instead of a financial sanction` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- D18/D19: the procedures not approved (by the AG or an authorised deputy): no warning.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 52(a) — the Commissioner may give an administrative warning instead of a financial sanction` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- The circumstances are not among those the procedures list: no warning.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 52(a) — the Commissioner may give an administrative warning instead of a financial sanction` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- No reasonable grounds: no warning.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 52(a) — the Commissioner may give an administrative warning instead of a financial sanction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- The warning states what s.52(b) requires.
#ASSERT `s 52(b) — the administrative warning states what the Law requires` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE)

§§ `D20, D22: s 53, the request to cancel, within 30 days`

-- D20: warning delivered 2027-03-01 (anchor taken: delivery, X10): last day 2027-03-31; 2027-04-01 is late.
#ASSERT `s 53(a), (b) — the last day to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `counting from its delivery, given` NOTHING `with` `no rest days` EQUALS YMD 2027 3 31
#ASSERT `s 53(a) — the day` (YMD 2027 3 31) `is within the period to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `given` NOTHING `with` `no rest days`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 53(a) — the day` (YMD 2027 4 1) `is within the period to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `given` NOTHING `with` `no rest days`)
-- With s.10(c): warning delivered 2027-02-04, nominal last day Saturday 2027-03-06 a rest day: 2027-03-07.
#ASSERT `s 53(a), (b) — the last day to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 2 4) `cancelled` FALSE) `counting from its delivery, given` NOTHING `with` (`rest on` (LIST (YMD 2027 3 6))) EQUALS YMD 2027 3 7
-- D22: an extension for recorded special reasons governs; without recorded reasons it does not.
#ASSERT `s 53(a), (b) — the last day to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `counting from its delivery, given` (JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` WITH `the period now ends on` IS YMD 2027 4 20, `special reasons were recorded` IS TRUE)) `with` `no rest days` EQUALS YMD 2027 4 20
#ASSERT `s 53(a), (b) — the last day to ask to cancel` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 3 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `counting from its delivery, given` (JUST (`Extension granted by the Commissioner` WITH `the period now ends on` IS YMD 2027 4 20, `special reasons were recorded` IS FALSE)) `with` `no rest days` EQUALS YMD 2027 3 31
-- D22: the decision is given in writing with reasons.
#ASSERT `s 53(c) — the decision is in writing and gives reasons` (`Written decision on a request to cancel a warning` WITH `delivered on` IS YMD 2027 4 10, `in writing` IS TRUE, `states the reasons` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 53(c) — the decision is in writing and gives reasons` (`Written decision on a request to cancel a warning` WITH `delivered on` IS YMD 2027 4 10, `in writing` IS TRUE, `states the reasons` IS FALSE))

§§ `D23-D26: s 54, continuing or repeating after a warning`

-- D23: the violator went on breaching the provision the warning concerned: a continuing violation for s.45(a).
#ASSERT `s 54(a) — a breach continued after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a continuing violation, the further breach being` `work with no licence at all` `and the violator having continued:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 54(a) — a breach continued after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a continuing violation, the further breach being` `work with no licence at all` `and the violator having continued:` FALSE)
-- D24: warning delivered 2027-04-01; the same provision breached again on 2029-04-01, the last day of the two years
-- from the DELIVERY of the warning: a repeat violation for s.45(b).
#ASSERT `s 54(b) — the further violation after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a repeat violation:` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 4 1))
-- D25: on 2029-04-02: not.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 54(b) — the further violation after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a repeat violation:` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 4 2)))
#ASSERT `s 54(b) — the last day of the two years from the delivery of` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) EQUALS YMD 2029 4 1
-- A different provision breached after the warning (s.4 after a warning about s.3(a)): not a repeat by s.54(b).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 54(b) — the further violation after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a repeat violation:` (`ind-c a further violation of` `advertising as licensed without the licence or the kind` `on` (YMD 2028 4 1)))
-- D26: a warning alone (no sanction, no conviction), repeated 23 months after its delivery: doubled via s.54(b),
-- item (1) for an individual, no update: 20,000 + 20,000.
#ASSERT `s 45 to 47 — the financial sanction for the violation` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 3 1)) 0 (`s 54(b) — the further violation after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a repeat violation:` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 3 1))) (YMD 2029 4 1) 2099 EMPTY EQUALS 40000
-- 25 months after delivery: not doubled, 20,000.
#ASSERT `s 45 to 47 — the financial sanction for the violation` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 5 1)) 0 (`s 54(b) — the further violation after` (`ind-c a warning about` `work with no licence at all` `delivered on` (YMD 2027 4 1) `cancelled` FALSE) `is treated as a repeat violation:` (`ind-c a further violation of` `work with no licence at all` `on` (YMD 2029 5 1))) (YMD 2029 6 1) 2099 EMPTY EQUALS 20000
